{"unit":3,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 3","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 3 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Work, home, things</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 7&ndash;9: jobs and <i>a/an</i>, <i>there is/are</i>, <i>have got</i>. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u3\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'm ___ nurse.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">He's ___ engineer.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What do you ___? — I'm a teacher.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">work</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">make</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___ a sofa in the room.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">It is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ two windows in the kitchen.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">They are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">Is there a garden? — Yes, ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">it is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">there is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">there are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I've ___ a phone and a key.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">gots</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">got</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">get</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">___ you got a pen?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Have</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">Have you got a car? — No, I ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">haven't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hasn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">don't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">She's ___ artist.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">There ___ any trees in the garden.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">aren't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">What's in your ___? — A book and keys.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">room</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">bag</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">job</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Say the job: teacher (I)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'm a teacher.|I am a teacher.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Write it: three chairs<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are three chairs.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You have got a key.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Have you got a key?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: He's a engineer.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He's an engineer.|He is an engineer.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: There is two beds.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are two beds.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}